msgstr "Register your farms, crops, and lot requests to offer your agricultural products."

msgid "Compradores"
msgstr "Buyers"

msgid "Encuentra productos agrícolas y lotes disponibles de diferentes productores."
msgstr "Find agricultural products and available lots from different producers."

